  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "電鍍技術與實務",
    "sub_ename": "TECHNOLOGY AND PRACTICE OF ELECTROPLATING",
    "describe_ch": "電鍍技術賦與材料美觀與表面改質特性，為一門實用科學。本課程介紹電化學基礎、前處理、各種金屬/合金之電鍍原理和實務、鍍後處理，並包括廠務與環境議題；課程並將電化學、材料試驗融入課程內容。此課程為以課堂講授搭配hands-on實驗實作的應用學科，課程實施將側重於學理原理與方法論。",
    "describe_eh": "Technology of electrodeposition provides surface functional modification and outlook improvement of materials. This course is a practical science. The contents include fundamental electrochemistry, pretreatment, principles and practice of metal/alloy electrodeposition as well as post-treatment are included. Factory and environment related topics are also covered. Electrochemistry and materials testing are in conjunction with the course contents. This course combines theoretical lecturing and hands-on experiments, emphasizing the principles and methodologies.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
